# DENY BY DEFAULT, then re-admit what the probe image needs, IN SORTED ORDER.
#
# The probe's Dockerfile does `COPY . /src/`, so an ignore list of "the big
# directories" copies whatever else is in the working tree — including exactly
# the files .gitignore calls out as carrying a real host, account or ticket:
# .env, .env.local, *.keytab, *.ccache. Baked into an image layer, that outlives
# deleting the file. An allowlist cannot be widened by forgetting something.
#
# The re-admissions are SORTED. Apple's `container` build refuses an unsorted
# set with `changes out of order: "test/cpp" "src/xmla_extension.cpp"`, which
# reads like a corrupt context and is really just this list's ordering.
*
!.clang-format
!CMakeLists.txt
!scripts
!src
!test
!tools

# Belt and braces: even if a rule above ever re-admits a parent, these never
# come in. Constitution I.
.env
.env.*
*.keytab
*.ccache
*.pem
*.key
